WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:02.400
SHUT UP, CHOROMI!

00:03.020 --> 00:04.650
This is a house of gods.

00:05.010 --> 00:07.470
No matter who comes in here, if they ask us for help, we'll save them.

00:07.990 --> 00:08.670
Got it?

00:08.980 --> 00:09.560
Yes...

00:12.730 --> 00:15.280
I'm going back to Heaven...

00:16.040 --> 00:17.950
That's why you're being so nice to me, right?

00:18.920 --> 00:21.060
You really don't have any use for me.

00:22.240 --> 00:27.540
Even if you don't love me, if just told me you needed me...

00:28.660 --> 00:31.120
If you told me you loved me...

00:52.610 --> 00:54.520
Kamiyama, is Tenko...?

00:54.730 --> 00:58.080
Yeah, she should be okay.

00:58.770 --> 01:03.110
Uh, I'll be sleeping on the floor, so you should get some rest too, Kumiko.

01:03.570 --> 01:05.620
Is it okay for me to sleep in this room?

01:06.300 --> 01:11.650
It's not a problem. If Fumiko tries to come after you, I should be wherever you are.

01:12.040 --> 01:14.690
Protecting girls is a man's duty.

01:22.560 --> 01:24.280
Thank you, Kamiyama.

01:25.020 --> 01:27.110
A family really is a warm thing, isn't it?

01:35.850 --> 01:40.180
Angels' Prayers. Bonds that Connect

01:54.640 --> 01:56.110
S-she's here!

02:05.740 --> 02:08.010
M-ma?

02:11.450 --> 02:14.370
Sorry, Kamiyama. I did it.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.890
You... did... it?

02:19.240 --> 02:20.710
Well, you know...

02:21.680 --> 02:26.240
"Do whatever you want with my life, but please spare the kids!"

02:26.650 --> 02:28.540
Or something like that, so...

02:36.720 --> 02:38.250
Kamiyama, you look positively livid!

02:38.390 --> 02:39.860
Just a little bit more? How about this?

02:43.820 --> 02:45.910
I'M GONNA KILL YOU!

02:46.990 --> 02:48.000
Samatarou!

02:48.930 --> 02:50.030
Ma?

02:51.030 --> 02:52.910
You shouldn't do that, Samatarou!

02:53.120 --> 02:54.940
Violence never solved anything!

02:55.170 --> 02:58.170
Violence only stirs the demons in one's heart!

02:58.790 --> 03:05.910
What's wrong? Stop with all that talk and get over here!

03:05.980 --> 03:12.330
Samatarou! In everyone's heart resides a small devil that can take over at any time!

03:12.380 --> 03:14.220
But you can't let it grow!

03:14.450 --> 03:17.490
Don't be pulled over to that side, Samatarou!

03:19.600 --> 03:21.650
Let's try using persuasion!

03:21.650 --> 03:23.580
Stand against violence! PEACE! Poof!

03:26.870 --> 03:28.050
Well shit...

03:29.400 --> 03:31.450
Hey, you?

03:31.760 --> 03:34.470
Do you know what happens when you respect the independence of kids?

03:34.740 --> 03:36.470
DON'T TOUCH MY MOTHER!

03:36.730 --> 03:37.430
Mama?

03:42.490 --> 03:48.880
Noooooooooooooooooo!

03:46.900 --> 03:47.660
Meme!

03:48.550 --> 03:51.530
Samatarou! Protect Meme from going to the other side!

03:52.430 --> 03:53.790
Shut it, you stinky little brat!

03:57.000 --> 03:57.660
YOU!

03:58.080 --> 03:58.890
Samatarou!

04:01.470 --> 04:03.920
If you do that, you won't be any different from that devil.

04:07.790 --> 04:09.700
Go to where Tenko and Kumiko are.

04:10.380 --> 04:11.020
But...

04:11.020 --> 04:13.300
Can't you take an order from your older sister? Hurry up.

04:17.090 --> 04:20.360
Okay. Sis, don't get killed!

04:20.630 --> 04:23.550
Okay, okay. Time to tag in.

04:28.440 --> 04:30.300
Kumiko, come with me!

04:30.840 --> 04:31.920
Come on! Hurry up!

04:55.110 --> 04:57.120
DON'T TOUCH HER!

04:57.120 --> 04:58.440
Hm?

05:00.220 --> 05:01.510
Mother, please stop!

05:01.880 --> 05:03.310
Why are you doing this?

05:03.790 --> 05:06.020
It's because you betrayed me, of course!

05:07.530 --> 05:10.330
A devil going to the other side. I can't believe it!

05:10.810 --> 05:15.260
You were a devil the day you were born, and you'll be a devil until the day you die!

05:16.340 --> 05:18.550
That's why you need to hurry up and come back.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.640
If I go back, will you stop all of this?

05:25.100 --> 05:27.390
I'll stop. I promise.

05:27.580 --> 05:28.140
It's a lie!

05:28.720 --> 05:30.250
You won't hurt Tenko?

05:30.500 --> 05:31.680
I won't hurt her.

05:32.340 --> 05:33.010
It's a lie!

05:33.440 --> 05:34.250
Really?

05:34.390 --> 05:37.170
"He who lies loses his tongue", ya know?

05:37.170 --> 05:39.090
Kumiko, don't believe her!

05:40.830 --> 05:42.610
Okay, thank you very much!

05:42.200 --> 05:42.990
Mother!

05:45.370 --> 05:48.370
I'm putting my faith in you.

05:55.740 --> 05:57.260
Kamiyama!

05:58.500 --> 05:59.860
I'll be waiting at the park.

06:00.730 --> 06:01.730
You understand, right?

06:02.180 --> 06:05.910
If you don't show up, my daughter just might die.

06:23.390 --> 06:25.630
Mother, thank you for everything.

06:31.610 --> 06:38.150
If Sis didn't stop me then... I don't know what I would've done.

06:42.070 --> 06:43.990
Always pretending to be cool...

06:45.150 --> 06:46.110
Don't worry.

06:46.560 --> 06:48.220
Once you wake up, this'll just be a story we can laugh about.

06:54.540 --> 06:58.010
Tenko, I need you.

06:59.270 --> 07:01.440
Be close to me, always.

07:14.580 --> 07:16.690
Samatarou, it's quite a relief to see you're safe!

07:16.690 --> 07:18.370
Suguru! Where were you?

07:18.370 --> 07:19.200
Ah...

07:20.150 --> 07:26.260
I was keeping guard at the entrance to the house, but I was blown away with the goddess in the explosion.

07:26.610 --> 07:27.750
Hm...

07:29.350 --> 07:30.420
Oh yeah.

07:32.510 --> 07:34.420
This might be my last one.

07:34.420 --> 07:36.780
Do say such an ominous thing!

07:38.230 --> 07:39.100
That's 500 yen.

07:39.370 --> 07:40.920
In total, you've deposited 1400 yen.

07:41.130 --> 07:44.380
As a present for customers giving 500 yen, here is a fortune.

07:45.100 --> 07:47.360
I don't need it, but I might as well take a look.

07:47.340 --> 07:50.010
BAD LUCK

07:52.190 --> 07:55.710
I put in 500 yen, and you're giving me a bad fortune?!

07:55.870 --> 07:58.420
That happens to be the result of telling my own fortune.

07:58.710 --> 08:02.330
Huh? I don't get it! What the Hell am I supposed to do with your fortune?

08:02.520 --> 08:04.470
But... If you want to turn back, now's the time.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.540
I'll be your companion, Lord Samatarou.

08:10.720 --> 08:13.640
Kamiyama, you're late!

08:14.900 --> 08:17.330
Lord Samatarou, what is that?

08:17.370 --> 08:20.040
Kumiko was saying something about a dog...

08:24.970 --> 08:27.270
So that's what his fortune was talking about.

08:28.430 --> 08:30.970
Oh my, did I break it?

08:31.760 --> 08:32.550
Kumiko!

08:33.210 --> 08:35.550
Here, now, a god will die!

08:36.210 --> 08:37.950
And this child will carry it out!

08:40.230 --> 08:41.490
I will kill...

08:44.560 --> 08:45.680
The god.

08:54.060 --> 08:56.070
Before that, can I say something?

08:56.960 --> 08:57.980
What is it?

08:57.980 --> 08:59.050
Going to beg for your life?

08:59.050 --> 09:00.690
Nope. I'm going to negotiate!

09:00.880 --> 09:01.830
Negotiate?

09:02.220 --> 09:09.220
Ahem. Eh, um... Devils, throw away your weapons and come out peacefully!

09:09.550 --> 09:11.690
Er, no, let's get along!

09:12.160 --> 09:17.300
Um, Kumiko, let's go home!

09:21.130 --> 09:21.960
Is that it?

09:22.270 --> 09:23.990
I can't think of anything else!

09:25.950 --> 09:30.530
Well then, Kumiko, go and feed me a delicious soul.

09:32.410 --> 09:36.060
The time I spent with you was very precious to me.

09:36.540 --> 09:39.460
I doubt that I will ever forget those memories.

09:39.910 --> 09:42.190
But, the time for us to part has come.

09:42.380 --> 09:45.300
I don't think we'll ever meet again.

09:49.600 --> 09:50.600
Kumiko!

09:50.680 --> 09:51.530
Goodbye.

10:03.660 --> 10:05.440
Kumiko, you...!

10:05.730 --> 10:07.680
You betrayed your mother!

10:07.870 --> 10:09.920
Someone like you couldn't be my mother!

10:09.920 --> 10:12.730
Give me back my loving mother!

10:12.730 --> 10:17.270
Idiot! That was all an act! A lie!

10:17.270 --> 10:20.580
Even if it was an act or a lie, it meant everything to me!

10:21.310 --> 10:22.960
That was my mother...

10:22.960 --> 10:25.740
NOW YOU'RE JUST A REGULAR DEVIL!

10:25.740 --> 10:26.570
SHUT UP!

10:32.280 --> 10:33.170
Kumiko!

10:34.660 --> 10:38.560
Kamiyama... save... save my mother!

10:39.010 --> 10:39.680
I understand.

10:45.430 --> 10:48.830
It might be more fun like this... to have a handicap.

10:50.570 --> 10:51.580
Use this!

10:52.020 --> 10:54.050
You want to kill me, don't you?

10:55.910 --> 10:58.090
My weapon is... persuasion!

10:58.420 --> 11:00.840
I thought I could enjoy this at least a little bit...

11:01.210 --> 11:04.550
But if you want it to be like that, I'll make you into my meal now!

11:08.710 --> 11:12.310
OWW!  My head got smacked pretty hard and my back really hurts!

11:12.640 --> 11:14.400
One more shot!

11:18.130 --> 11:20.600
Ow....owww!

11:20.600 --> 11:22.020
You can't stop running your mouth, can you?

11:29.930 --> 11:31.840
Looks like it's time to finish the job.

11:31.840 --> 11:32.590
Wait!

11:32.710 --> 11:33.290
Huh?

11:41.740 --> 11:42.770
I knew it.

11:43.710 --> 11:45.860
Sorry for being late, Samatarou.

11:46.360 --> 11:51.120
Go home, Tenko. After today your duty here ends!

11:51.260 --> 11:52.090
Just go back!

11:52.490 --> 11:55.180
I won't go back... because...

11:55.920 --> 11:57.540
I... by Samatarou...

11:58.550 --> 12:02.140
What are you doing? Think clearly! She's a monster!

12:02.220 --> 12:05.510
I'm an angel. Protecting you is my duty.

12:08.660 --> 12:11.190
OWW! I think I got a bump!

12:11.560 --> 12:13.440
That's why I was saying you can't protect me...

12:20.690 --> 12:22.290
Please, go back...

12:22.800 --> 12:24.580
I won't go back.

12:25.160 --> 12:27.050
That's enough, Tenko.

12:27.840 --> 12:31.380
I'd never leave your side, not as long as you need me.

12:32.160 --> 12:34.280
So you were pretending to sleep?

12:34.540 --> 12:37.440
No, I couldn't move or talk.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.980
But I was truly happy.

12:43.320 --> 12:46.910
I'll never forget what happened then.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.500
Nooo!

12:48.650 --> 12:53.060
This dog was a throwaway, so it really hates humans.

12:53.290 --> 12:54.570
TENKO!

12:58.610 --> 12:59.190
I give.

13:03.950 --> 13:05.750
I like eyes like that.

13:06.350 --> 13:08.420
Hurry up and come over here!

13:09.790 --> 13:14.510
My weapon is persuasion, my weapon is persuasion! My weapon is...

13:14.860 --> 13:15.940
Persuasion, okay?

13:16.230 --> 13:17.310
Stand against violence.

13:17.580 --> 13:18.920
Do your best or something.

13:20.740 --> 13:21.430
I've decided.

13:22.050 --> 13:23.230
Prepare yourself!

13:26.270 --> 13:31.000
You know a devil's weak spot is their chest, even though Kumiko missed mine!

13:31.290 --> 13:31.580
Thanks!

13:33.830 --> 13:35.470
I won't miss!!

13:38.720 --> 13:42.710
OWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW!

13:43.190 --> 13:44.940
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

13:45.270 --> 13:47.440
I won't go to your side, no matter what!

13:48.080 --> 13:49.890
I won't be consumed by hatred.

13:50.190 --> 13:54.510
I'll kill the devil living inside of me!

13:57.850 --> 14:01.130
I'm a god, and gods are the world!

13:57.850 --> 14:01.130
Note: I almost used "God" here instead.

14:05.040 --> 14:08.450
Why am I being hurt when you injure yourself?!

14:05.040 --> 14:08.450
Rather than rant on forever in notes, I'll just say it was hard to decide what to do here and in the next few lines.

14:08.530 --> 14:10.790
I won't accept this!

14:10.790 --> 14:12.990
I'm the one who won't accept this!

14:13.350 --> 14:17.230
Putting Kumiko through so much pain, and then tearing apart my family!

14:20.140 --> 14:23.150
Today, this god herby declares...

14:23.530 --> 14:25.650
That this is the end for you, Fumiko!

14:26.110 --> 14:28.840
Persuasion complete!

14:58.450 --> 15:00.700
Samatarou? Samatarou!

15:03.020 --> 15:05.090
Hold on, Samatarou!

15:05.380 --> 15:07.090
Kamiyama...?

15:07.090 --> 15:09.770
Don't die! I won't let you die.

15:09.870 --> 15:12.410
Samatarou! Samatarou!

15:14.090 --> 15:15.740
Kumiko, please pray!

15:16.090 --> 15:17.650
All we can hope for here is a miracle!

15:18.040 --> 15:19.150
A miracle?

15:19.220 --> 15:21.820
Samatarou is a god, and I'm an angel!

15:22.080 --> 15:23.180
So please, pray with us!

15:23.670 --> 15:24.210
But...

15:24.890 --> 15:27.160
Don't you care about Samatarou?

15:27.870 --> 15:30.390
Don't falter. Just believe in your own strength!

15:31.040 --> 15:34.380
That's... but, I'm a devil.

15:34.840 --> 15:35.600
What's that?

15:35.660 --> 15:37.160
I'm sorry.

15:37.550 --> 15:38.440
Not that...

15:39.010 --> 15:40.150
On your back...

15:44.010 --> 15:46.960
Why? I'm not an angel...

15:49.010 --> 15:50.290
Me too!

15:54.050 --> 15:54.680
This is...

15:55.020 --> 15:56.910
Anyway, we need to pray! Let's do it!

15:57.100 --> 15:57.600
Okay!

16:02.990 --> 16:05.570
Grant Samatarou protection from further harm.

16:06.080 --> 16:08.210
Grant him the ability to smile once more.

16:16.360 --> 16:17.030
Please...

16:17.200 --> 16:18.150
Please...

16:18.780 --> 16:21.260
Please, save Samatarou!

16:26.990 --> 16:28.680
OWWW!

16:30.590 --> 16:32.760
Ugh! Man that hurt!

16:32.760 --> 16:33.800
Samatarou!

16:33.880 --> 16:35.730
W-w-what is it, Tenko?

16:35.950 --> 16:37.170
Let's kiss!

16:37.170 --> 16:38.530
No way!

16:47.230 --> 16:53.570
It's now a few days after the miracle that Tenko, Kumiko and the Kamiyama family brought about...

16:54.220 --> 16:57.290
Why do you need me to do this?

16:57.480 --> 17:00.000
My wounds haven't even healed yet...

17:00.160 --> 17:01.910
Stop your whining and work!

17:02.330 --> 17:03.910
Yeah! Work!

17:04.810 --> 17:08.060
Kumiko, you don't have to help out.

17:08.060 --> 17:09.490
It's okay if you take a break!

17:09.490 --> 17:12.390
No, doing this is a lot of fun!

17:16.110 --> 17:18.020
Looks like you're having fun, Meme.

17:19.870 --> 17:22.270
Samatarou, look at this!

17:22.580 --> 17:25.670
The New Kamiyama House!

17:23.410 --> 17:25.970
Your room's going to be cut in half!

17:26.010 --> 17:26.880
Why?

17:26.800 --> 17:30.880
Choromi

17:26.800 --> 17:30.880
Samatarou-chan

17:26.800 --> 17:30.880
Wall

17:26.800 --> 17:30.880
Veranda

17:27.310 --> 17:30.990
Because we need to build Choromi's room there, of course!

17:31.820 --> 17:35.700
Or maybe you'd like to sleep with me instead?

17:36.150 --> 17:37.120
Half is fine.

17:39.060 --> 17:40.950
Let go of me!

17:40.950 --> 17:42.120
"Half is fine"?!

17:41.330 --> 17:42.670
--Let go of me!

17:46.490 --> 17:48.530
I have one thing I'd like to ask.

17:48.730 --> 17:49.540
What is it?

17:49.830 --> 17:53.550
What's the relationship between you and Kumiko's mother?

17:53.610 --> 17:55.550
Ah, we used to be co-workers.

17:55.550 --> 17:58.870
Co-workers? That devil used to be an angel?

17:58.870 --> 18:01.720
Yes. Fuu used to be an angel.

18:02.490 --> 18:05.010
She fell in love with a human man.

18:05.330 --> 18:10.350
They exchanged vows of love, and from the two of them, one Kumiko was born.

18:11.000 --> 18:15.270
However, the human couldn't become accustomed to living with angels.

18:15.550 --> 18:19.560
But the same can be said for many humans in similar situations.

18:20.350 --> 18:22.710
He left Fuu's side.

18:23.680 --> 18:29.680
The shattering of their love wounded Fuu's heart, and stained it pure red.

18:32.120 --> 18:37.200
Then, the woman who had been consumed by the latent devil inside her began to take revenge on mankind.

18:38.720 --> 18:41.930
That's why Kumiko became an angel back then...

18:42.540 --> 18:44.230
Because she's really the child of an angel.

18:44.450 --> 18:48.860
That's right. Kumiko escaped the clutches of the devil within her, and returned to this world.

18:49.470 --> 18:54.290
The lives of humans, angels, gods... of everything... persist in a state of balanced fragility.

18:54.550 --> 18:57.910
If someone slips, one's world changes in an instant.

18:58.290 --> 19:00.430
It happens to the good and the bad...

19:05.910 --> 19:06.750
It's time.

19:08.350 --> 19:11.200
Is it really okay, not going back to Heaven?

19:11.810 --> 19:14.860
Yeah. I have family here.

19:15.360 --> 19:16.600
I can't leave them behind, can I?

19:18.230 --> 19:20.420
I see. You're right.

19:21.440 --> 19:24.610
It'll be a little sad. What should I get you as a parting gift?

19:25.080 --> 19:26.760
A toaster or something'd be just fine.

19:28.920 --> 19:32.820
Say hello to my mother and father in Heaven!

19:42.010 --> 19:42.580
Okay, then.

19:44.240 --> 19:46.520
Heeey! You're slacking off.

19:46.760 --> 19:47.920
You too...

19:48.670 --> 19:49.530
What's up?

19:50.340 --> 19:53.270
Well, you know, I have something to tell you.

19:54.970 --> 19:56.170
What? What is it?

19:59.000 --> 19:59.690
Samatarou?

20:02.900 --> 20:05.720
Angels want to be happy too.

20:07.300 --> 20:08.800
Yeah, okay...

20:12.490 --> 20:16.560
Man, I'm tired of this. Having no contact with my family.

20:16.840 --> 20:18.550
Things were hard for you, weren't they?

20:18.850 --> 20:21.600
To think that a devil could have so much power...

20:21.980 --> 20:26.860
As soon as I put the door back up, mama came bursting through, saying that she was scared.

20:27.610 --> 20:28.810
Oh, how she cried.

20:29.970 --> 20:33.160
Even so, Samatarou, you've become an adult, haven't you?

20:33.670 --> 20:35.820
Papa can rest a little bit better now!

20:36.170 --> 20:38.440
I'll be able to devote myself to my job like this.

20:39.500 --> 20:40.760
Aren't you a little sad?

20:40.940 --> 20:42.630
Being away from Tenko?

20:42.830 --> 20:46.590
It might take some time before I become accustomed to being alone again.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.900
She said to say hello, didn't she?

20:50.410 --> 20:51.570
Have you still not told her?

20:51.750 --> 20:52.670
It's still a secret.

20:52.970 --> 20:56.510
I think her current state is the best thing for her right now.

20:57.040 --> 20:59.600
It really is tough being a father.

21:00.450 --> 21:02.870
Oh, can you water that with the elephant?

21:02.950 --> 21:04.210
As you wish.

21:05.840 --> 21:07.000
Coins, coins...

21:07.630 --> 21:09.010
Oh, I have one!

21:15.840 --> 21:16.670
That's 500 yen.

21:16.950 --> 21:18.700
In total, you have 1900 yen.

21:18.990 --> 21:20.310
Please take your fortune.

21:20.450 --> 21:21.300
Let's see...

21:21.280 --> 21:23.400
Great Luck

21:21.280 --> 21:23.400
Fortune #18

21:21.770 --> 21:23.420
Great luck! The person you've been waiting for has come!

21:24.030 --> 21:25.160
Really?!

21:26.040 --> 21:29.330
From today, I'll be having you work in this room.

21:30.290 --> 21:32.790
Your companion will be this newcomer, Fuu.

21:33.250 --> 21:35.140
This is a veteran, Suu.

21:36.630 --> 21:38.090
Please take good care of me.

21:38.580 --> 21:43.370
I don't know much, as I've forgotten all my previous memories, but I'll try my best.

21:45.260 --> 21:46.520
Teach her everything you can!

21:46.690 --> 21:49.570
Things about the hearts of angels, or things about humans, okay?

21:51.480 --> 21:52.990
I'm Suguru.

21:53.680 --> 22:00.100
Let me teach you the most important thing for both us and for humans.

22:00.610 --> 22:01.280
Okay.

22:02.330 --> 22:08.330
It's that life is something that can be started over -- redone any number of times -- and all it takes is to ask.

22:10.240 --> 22:12.660
What's up? Asking us to show up in our uniforms all of the sudden?

22:12.880 --> 22:14.660
You surprised us!

22:14.660 --> 22:15.870
Thanks for waiting!

22:21.660 --> 22:23.690
I'm a little embarrassed, but...

22:24.240 --> 22:25.620
Nice, Samatarou!

22:25.620 --> 22:27.720
That looks amazing on her!

22:27.720 --> 22:29.470
Okay, that's enough.

22:29.470 --> 22:30.540
Shinichi.

22:30.730 --> 22:34.040
Okay! Time to take a picture to remember this occasion!

22:34.040 --> 22:34.970
Mama...

22:40.220 --> 22:42.290
Ready? Okay, chee-

22:42.290 --> 22:43.510
Look over there.

22:49.140 --> 22:50.480
Hey, that's cold!

22:50.950 --> 22:52.410
Meme, you're such a trickster.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.830
Samatarou, one more!

23:10.620 --> 23:16.110
The world suddenly changed one morning

23:16.980 --> 23:22.570
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

23:22.980 --> 23:26.960
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

23:29.820 --> 23:34.560
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:36.070 --> 23:41.260
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:41.500 --> 23:47.850
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:48.730 --> 23:54.970
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:56.240 --> 24:02.190
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

24:02.190 --> 24:07.920
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

24:07.950 --> 24:09.800
Please answer my prayer!

24:09.830 --> 24:17.610
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

24:17.650 --> 24:22.780
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:30.050 --> 24:35.020
Thank you for watching!
